Explain leaf more as a simulation engine, allowing for the processing of animations, games, model rendering to be as
simple as possible, wether you render one thing or multiple is functions the same and just as simple. 

Required Library list

Immeidate mode gui lib, supporting all platforms in zig.
 - Requires Gizmo support as well.
Compiler for all shader langauges.
 - GLSL
 - HLSL
 - WSGL
Program dispatcher for abstracting zig calls in other languages.
 - Rust
 - Python
 - Typescript 
 - Lua
Parser / Serializer for TOML, AESPRITE, FBX, OBJ, STL written in pure zig.
 - zig
Math lib in zig. Probably a cimport.